性能/时延


启动时驱动器初始化: CAN_Init → RPDO1_Config → Profile_Velocity_Init → NMT_Control → Driver_Enable(0x06→0x07→0x0F) → CPG_Init


响应帧 29字节: Byte[3..6]把手1Fx ... Byte[23..26]把手2Fz (IEEE754 Big-Endian)
查询帧 8字节: 0x01 0x03 0x0400 0x000C CRC16  →  USART2 PD4 DE(高=发) PD5/PD6 TX/RX
